#: mitchell_food/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "FOOD"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/8
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Pitiful. Utterly mismatched flavor profiles, textures a mess..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/19
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/27/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "My friend - you return?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/28/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Yes? What is it, love?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/29/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Ugh. You? Speak."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've got a delivery from Daisuke."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mitchell waves a hand at you."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Ah, yes. Unpack them for me, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uhh, sure."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mitchell looks over your deliveries, nodding his approval."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Brilliant. These are perfect for what I need. They should look spectacular in the dining room."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/c-0/23/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Does it really matter that much? These are just plates."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/c-0/23/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Just plates? JUST plates?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/c-0/23/c-0/34/c-0/18
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Food is an artform, and the plate is the canvas. The presentation is a non-negotiable part of the deal."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/c-0/23/c-0/34/c-0/26
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Plating is as vital to a dish as the seasoning. It elevates the entire experience!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/c-0/23/c-0/34/c-0/37
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Without Daisuke's hard work keeping me supplied, my dishes would be nowhere near Michelin-level."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/c-0/23/c-0/34/c-0/45/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess I should be more appreciative of my dishware."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/c-0/23/c-0/34/c-0/45/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Damn right you should."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/c-0/23/c-0/34/c-0/45/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Daisuke spent years refining his craft creating his own ceramics."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/c-0/23/c-0/34/c-0/45/c-0/23
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "He has a respect for the work you simply can't be taught otherwise. You'd do well to model yourself after him."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/dishes_food/0/c-0/23/c-0/34/c-0/45/c-0/31
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Now, if you'll excuse me, I have reviews to complete."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_dish_end/0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You delivered to me last?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_dish_end/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. Is that an issue?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_dish_end/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Hm."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_dish_end/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Well. Carry on, then."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_preintro/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The first word that comes to mind as you evaluate the strange figure standing before you is 'delicious'—you don't even intend to be salacious, it's just... he looks... edible."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_preintro/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "His long blonde hair calls to mind ramen noodles, but his entire outfit is a culinary journey around the globe. He looks downright mouth-watering, but you're not sure the feeling is mutual. His expression suggests he's less than impressed with you."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_preintro/0/16
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Good evening."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_preintro/0/24
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Do have a seat. I'll be with you in just a minute."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_preintro/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Looks like you're really enjoying that glass of wine."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_preintro/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Glass of wine? Surely you can do better than that..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_preintro/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "This fine white has a light body, and is rather dry."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_preintro/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "It's quite acidic."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_preintro/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I can virtually taste its origins in the Eastern Loire Valley. Dare I guess just outside Chavignol?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_preintro/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And as its taste matures on my tongue..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_preintro/0/c-0/47
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I detect notes of honeydew, grapefruit, and peach."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_preintro/0/c-0/55
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And a certain minerality. Flint, gray salt."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Definitely a Chardonnay."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a Sauvignon Blanc."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Riesling, then?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test/0/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's not a white at all. It's a rosé."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Close... But Chardonnay is from Burgundy. I'll give you one more try."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Well done!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Pathetic. Just pathetic."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "A rosé? Do I look like I'm eating barbecued prawns?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Now, can you do even better?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It probably pairs nicely with goat cheese."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm going to say... Chablis?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd guess it's a Sancerre."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know my limits."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Indeed! An excellent idea."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And maybe some chive crackers?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-0/24/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Well now you're just showing off. And I'm very much here for it."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Well. That's a disappointment."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-1/24
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You do know that Chablis is an entirely different wine, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-1/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Guess I just got lucky the first time..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-1/32/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I guess so."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You've hit it spot on. I did not realize I was in the presence of a master sommelier!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-2/24
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "How did you know?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-2/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lucky guess?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-2/32/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You said Eastern Loire. But it was Chavignol that really gave it away."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-2/32/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Though with the taste of flint, it could've been a Pouilly Fume, I suppose..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-2/32/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You and I both know luck had nothing to do with it."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-2/32/c-1/7 mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Marvelous!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-2/32/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "My word. You are astonishing."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-2/32/g-0/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sometimes you just get lucky."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-2/32/g-0/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know my stuff."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/wine_test2/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Wisdom always does! There's nothing wrong with humility whatsoever."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/3
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "But where are my manners? Allow me to introduce myself."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/11
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'm Mitchell Linn, food critic extraordinaire."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/19
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Paragon of the perfect, advocate of the adventurous, and bane of the banal."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You must really like food then, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I consider myself something of a foodie, actually."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Food! Can't live with it. Can't live without it."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have you heard of Soylint? I'm really into Soylint lately."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Like it? I LIVE for it. And not just food, but the whole of the experience."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "The ambiance! That interplay of sound, sight, and scent that whets the appetite and inspires the mind."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "The art of service, be it subtle theater, delightful formality, or downright brutish charm."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And of course the meal itself."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "From the minutiae of the menu, to the presentation on the plate, and the very titillation of the tongue."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/c-0/47
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Dining, in all its forms, is the blood that flows in my veins."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/c-1/7/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I have to say I already find your taste QUITE impressive."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/c-1/8/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You've already begun to prove that!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/c-1/9/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Oh really? Could have fooled me..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "What, pray tell, does that mean?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Honestly, I'm not even sure what I meant by that. Sometimes I just say things."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're really hot."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/c-2/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I, uh, thank you?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'm going to pretend I didn't hear that."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Listen, I'm afraid you've caught me in a bit of a hurry."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Three new spots have just opened up around the house."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'm eager to give them a try, and see if they measure up to my exacting standards."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Say... How would you like to accompany me?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That would be great!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not really hungry right now."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/g-0/c-4/11
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Brilliant!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/g-0/c-5/11
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Then I'm afraid this is goodbye for now!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_intro/0/g-0/c-5/19
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Come back and see me whenever you'd like to go out for a bite."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HungryYet/0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Hello again. I'm just about to head out to a review. Care to join me?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HungryYet/0/8/s/0 mitchell_food/MeetingAgain/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love to!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HungryYet/0/9/s/0 mitchell_food/MeetingAgain/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Too bad. I just ate."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HungryYet/0/10/s/0 mitchell_food/MeetingAgain/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was thinking maybe we could just talk..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HungryYet/0/c-1/7 mitchell_food/MeetingAgain/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Pity, that. See you later!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HungryYet/0/c-2/7 mitchell_food/MeetingAgain/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'd love to, really."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HungryYet/0/c-2/15 mitchell_food/MeetingAgain/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "But I'm afraid without my reviews, the culinary prospects of this house would be dire indeed."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HungryYet/0/c-2/23/0/s/0 mitchell_food/MeetingAgain/0/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll come along, then."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HungryYet/0/c-2/23/1/s/0 mitchell_food/MeetingAgain/0/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok. I'll see you another time, then."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HungryYet/0/c-2/23/c-0/11 mitchell_food/MeetingAgain/0/c-2/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Excellent!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MeetingAgain/0/3
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Ah! My faithful companion!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MeetingAgain/0/11
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Care to join me for another review?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/4
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You find Mitchell looking more pensive than usual. He sits staring off into the distance, absently swirling a glass of red."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/12
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He notices you when you approach, and you catch a glint of something in his eyes."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/20
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Bon soir, mon... ami?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/28
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Mon... cheri?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/36
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Sometimes I get so wrapped up in what I'm doing that I forget the most essential things."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Such as?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Mon cheri? I like the sound of that..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is something wrong, Mitchell?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Such as questioning what's really at the heart of it all."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "There's something I'd very much like to ask you."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Yes, well... You've been on my mind."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I've wanted to ask your opinion about something."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Not at all, not at all. In fact, something has never been more right."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "May I ask you something?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ask away!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Anything."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm... already spoken for, Mitchell."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Ah! Of course. I should have known..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And while this disappoints me, I must say that wasn't going to be my question."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Do you think there is a connection between food and love?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Specifically, do you think that by eating with another, delighting in delicacies..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Appreciating the ambiance of a fine establishment..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Engaging in pleasant conversation and the elegant dance of table manners..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Can these things make love?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They can actually get in love's way."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They cannot make it, but they can reveal it."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They are themselves an act of love."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "How can this be?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I've spent my whole life believing that the path to my heart lay directly through my stomach."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-6/23
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "But perhaps there's more to life than food. Perhaps I ought to expand my horizons."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-6/31
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Hm. I fear this has put me in a rather sour mood."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-6/42
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Return another time, and we can 'get in love's way' together, no?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "These are wise words, and I must ponder them..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-7/15 mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-8/26
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Do return soon, yes?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-7/23 mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-8/34
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I must say I am eagerly awaiting our next rendezvous."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-7/31 mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-8/42
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I have begun to find you rather... entrancing."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-7/39 mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-8/50
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "But tonight, I need some time with this glass of wine."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-7/47 mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-8/58
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "That is to say, time to be with myself."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "An act of love... Do you mean to say that love is created by what we do?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FoodOfLove/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "This is a beautiful sentiment, and one that goes straight to my heart."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/WhereShouldWeEat/0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "So, where should we go?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/WhereShouldWeEat/0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "There's a new hawaiian-fusion place in the living room."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/WhereShouldWeEat/0/11/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Daisuke's sushi spot in the dining room is supposed to be pretty swanky."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/WhereShouldWeEat/0/14/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Freddy Yeti has an ice cream joint in the kitchen that's worth checking out."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/WhereShouldWeEat/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's do sushi!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/WhereShouldWeEat/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hawaiian-fusion? I'm in!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/WhereShouldWeEat/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You had me at 'ice cream.'"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mitchell leads you to the dining room—he seems excited, or about as excited as a critic like Mitchell can be about a new place."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/24
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I've heard only good things about Daisuke's place so far."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/32
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Let's hope it lives up to expectation."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/37
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You walk into a rather austere space, every element seemingly selected for its clean and unpretentious elegance."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/42
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The counters are of raw pine, finished to a glossy luster."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/47
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The walls are shoji-style screens, and the doors slide open with a soft hiss that seems engineered to bring you entirely into your sophisticated surroundings."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/52
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A water feature drips delightfully in the background."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/57
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You feel instantaneously relaxed and intrigued."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/65
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Ah, here comes the owner now."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/76
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Irasshaimase!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/90
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Daisuke greets you both with a warm smile."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/101
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Welcome to Omakase Daisuke. I am pleased to see you both."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/109
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Always nice to see you, Daisuke."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/117
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "It's obvious you've put a lot of work into this endeavor."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/125
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Thank you, Mitchell. I have only done what anyone would in my place."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/133
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "The dishware deserves no less than maximum effort."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/141
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "I hope the decor and ambiance please you."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/149
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "My mind isn't quite made up yet..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/157/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think it's exquisite, Daisuke."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/158/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eh. Feels a little too stuffy to me..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/159/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The slightly 'run down' quality... It's..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You do? Seems rather dull to me."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Look more closely. It's intentional. Not dull, but understated."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hmm. Now that you mention it, there's not really much going on here."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Understated, you say? Let me take a closer look..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Everything has been selected and arranged in order to draw one's full attention to the sushi."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Why, you're absolutely right. I thought at first it was lazy and weak decor..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Lazy and weak?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mitchell continues on, as though he's not heard Daisuke."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "But look around you."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/45
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Perfectly clean. Lighting muted but warm."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/53
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "This wood shows the signs of a master carpenter."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/61
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "These chairs have been selected with painstaking care."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/69
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And as I listen, I detect the subtle dripping of water from a waterfall pond."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/77
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "That is only Sinclaire's chronic drip, but I thank you all the same."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/85
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I feel almost as if I've been transported to the Sukibayashi Jiro!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/96
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Delightful! Simply delightful."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "No. Where is the zing? The pizazz?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Where is the originality?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'm afraid it's a bit too conservative for my bold taste."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-1/31
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Sushi is a simple yet elegant food, and should be presented as such."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-0/15/c-1/39
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "If you wish for bold presentation look elsewhere."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Hmm. Can you explain that a bit?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not a thing out of place. Overly pristine. Makes me feel like I'm not supposed to be here!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'm rather inclined to agree."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I don't mind luxury, but this? It's a bit much."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Luxury?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-1/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Daisuke gestures around you."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-1/15/c-0/39
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "I selected these pieces for their simplicity."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-1/15/c-0/47
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'm sorry Daisuke but I don't think I'm a fan."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-1/15/c-0/55
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "I see. That is a shame."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "It's what?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Rather offputting, I must say."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Absolutely masterful."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Unfortunately I think you're right. Not exactly inviting, is it?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-0/18
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "I am sorry you find my restaurant uninviting."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Run down? Masterful? Please explain."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A flawless example of the Japanese concept known as wabi-sabi."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A flawless example of the concept of shabby-chic."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A flawless example of brutalist decor."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A flawless example of Bohemian decor."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "That is... not what I intended, but I am glad you are familiar with the concept."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Its meaning is quite profound."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "It is the embrace of transience and the impermanence of all things."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "My goodness... You're right."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-0/39
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Think of a cracked bowl glued back together with gold: Used for who knows how many years before being placed reverently on a shelf?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-0/47
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Some day, that will be all of us."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-0/55
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Used with love until finished."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-0/63
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And then honored in retirement."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-0/71
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'm... I'm moved to tears."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-0/82
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And to think that without you pointing it out to me, I would have missed it."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-0/90
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "How can I thank you enough?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Shabby-chic? You think my restaurant is shabby?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Shabby, yes. Chic? No."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "How unfortunate."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Brutal???"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-2/18
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "If you understood brutalism you would never say that about this place."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-2/29
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "I do not know what you mean, but I feel I am being insulted just the same."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-2/37
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "You are lucky I do not eject you from your seat here and now."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-3/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Bohemian? Are you joking?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-3/18
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Are you simply guessing at style terms?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/c-2/23/c-1/15/c-3/26
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Your reckless words are undeserving of a place at this table."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Let's move on to your specialty, Daisuke... What are we to make of the settings?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Before we begin I am obligated to tell you that Scandalabra's stories about the silver are damaging lies and not to be believed."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/22
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Believe the Scandalabra? I'd sooner let Sinclaire process an insurance claim for me..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/33
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "I am glad we are all in agreement there."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/41
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Now let's have a look."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/49
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "We appear to be missing chopsticks."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why's that, Daisuke?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Chopsticks are properly only offered in Chinese restaurants."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Chopsticks are brought out after the first course."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Traditionally, sushi is eaten with the hands."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/c-3/7 mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/c-4/32 mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Traditionally, sushi is eaten with the hands."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Oh dear."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/c-4/24 mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "This is untrue. The answer is much simpler."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/c-4/40 mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/c-5/23 mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/c-6/30
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "But if you wish I can bring you some."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/c-6/19
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/c-6/38
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "No need! I'll eat in the traditional way."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-0/c-6/46
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And I must say, marvelous attention to detail, Daisuke."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Alright... Let's get down to business! I'm starving."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "As the name suggests, we offer only omakase."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Great! No need to order."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ooh, perfect. I love shellfish!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-1/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hmm. I don't like not having a selection."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-1/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seaweed only is an odd choice, I have to say."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-1/c-7/19
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I can't wait to see what's in store for us!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-1/c-8/13 mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-1/c-10/13
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I don't think that means what you think it does..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-1/c-9/19
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Me neither."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Ok, now when the first course comes, let's..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Give ourselves a minute or so to appreciate its beauty."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pretend to refuse it once before accepting."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-2/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eat it right away, as soon as it is delivered!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Sushi must be eaten right away! Within the first ten seconds."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-2/c-12/13
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Now that's an odd notion."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-2/c-13/13
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Yes! You really know your sushi etiquette."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-2/c-13/24
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Which I find very appealing, by the way..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Here you are. Please enjoy."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Daisuke places a dish before you containing what must be the most hideous, clumsy nigiri you've ever seen in your life."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The fish is misshapen, and the rice seems to be falling apart."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-3/30
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "What... what are we looking at, Daisuke?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-3/41
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Is it not obvious? This is eel."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-3/49
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "...I see."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-3/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No complaints from me!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-3/61/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you for trying your best, Daisuke."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-3/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Sip water and look away.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-3/c-14/13 mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-3/c-15/13
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Glad to know your take. I'll present my own opinions in the review..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/UpscaleSushi/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Now that we've eaten, I think it's time to go!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You find yourself in a large and comfy, side-of-the-street style stand."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa has blended traditional Hawaiian vibes with Korean elements."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/29/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He has somehow convinced Lux to don a red and blue outfit, in order to tastefully represent a traditional Korean lantern."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa has managed to bend himself around a grill in the center of the establishment, in classic Korean BBQ style."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/37/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But the Hawaiian vibe is very much in full swing, and the scent of Kahlua pork is drifting on the breeze (he's asked Wyndolyn to kindly crack herself a bit for the occasion!)."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/49
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Aloha friends!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/60
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Welcome to Two Currents! A Hawaiian-fusion experience!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/71
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "My, my, mon ami! You've worked hard to create the atmosphere."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/79
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Oh, not too hard!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/87
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Well... What do we think?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/95/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You've achieved a true fusion!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/96/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Awesome shoji lantern!!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/97/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Love the cheongsachorong. Nice touch."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/98/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shouldn't we be eating on Abel's back?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm humbled that you think so!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I agree, Koa. This is, so far, quite delightful!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Shoji?? That's Japanese..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "This traditional Korean lantern is called a cheongsachorong."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Oh goodness. How embarrassing!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/c-1/37
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You'll have to excuse my date for lack of refinement."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/c-1/45
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "All the same, Koa, the cheongsachorong is a thoughtful addition."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You knew what it was? I'm impressed!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mitchell beams, pride radiating from him."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/c-2/26
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "My date is quite worldly, Koa."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Aw, it's all good! You can just relax for a minute and chill here!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Hmm. I agree. It does seem a tad bit unsanitary."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Please, take a seat."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa pats his lap."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Don't mind if we do."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Is something the matter?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "How do we feel about these seats?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pretty stable! Can't complain."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel like I'm on \"two currents\" alright..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Koa's lap is pretty comfy!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Yes, I suppose this is a suitable arrangement."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I can barely stay upright! And the back rest is too far back from the food."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/c-5/18
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'd far prefer an arrangement like Chairemi and Abel have."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm glad to have you on it."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/c-6/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And me at the same time! How scandalous."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/c-6/23/b/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Did someone say 'SCANDAL?'"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/c-6/23/b/18
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Out!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/c-6/23/b/29
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/c-6/23/b/37
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Out!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/c-6/23/b/48
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I just..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/c-6/23/b/56
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "OUT!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-0/c-6/23/b/67
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh, phooey!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "If there's anything I can do to make things more comfy, just ask!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Noted."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Now... what do you recommend?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Here's a dish that's also of Korean origin: meat jun!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Thinly sliced beef dipped in egg batter and fried!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/43
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "And of course, some kalua pork, rice, and cucumber slices to go with it."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/59
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Intriguing. What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/67/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um... I don't eat meat. Remember?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/68/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's get that!!!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/69/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought this was fusion. Where's the Hawaiian influence?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/70/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Might I substitute the kalua pork for a side of, say, oi muchin?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Oh shoot! Well, no matter. I've got veggie options! Take a look at this menu..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/22/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you happen to have oi muchin?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/22/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about the lau lau instead?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/22/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll just have the mac salad."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/22/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't actually know which of these is veggies..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/22/c-0/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I can whip some up for you!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/22/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I am impressed! That wasn't even on the menu!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/22/c-1/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Huh? But that is made with pork and butterfish..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/22/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Why not just bring our guest some grilled veggies."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/22/c-1/23
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Clearly my date didn't know what it was."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/22/c-1/31
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Right away."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/22/c-1/39
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "That was awkward..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/22/c-2/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/22/c-3/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Oh! No problem. Here... I'll help you order."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/22/c-3/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'm impressed that you had the courage to just ask."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-7/22/c-3/23
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I find that attractive, I'll have you know.."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Make that two orders, and consider me intrigued!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Comin' right up!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-9/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Kalua pork is as Hawaiian as it gets!"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-9/20
msgctxt "Narration / joueur"
msgid ", do try to keep up."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-10/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Of course! We have some in back for special requests!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-10/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Well, well, look at you!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-10/26
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Asking for exactly what you want... and oi muchin wasn't even on the menu!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-1/c-10/34
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I find your confidence ravishing."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'll be right back with your food."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "In the meantime, how about some of our special soju?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No alcohol for me right now, thanks."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about something alcoholic instead?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-2/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Geonbae!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "No problem! Just water, then."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-2/c-12/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Soju is actually alcoholic!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-2/c-12/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And you can bring me a glass, thank you."
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-2/c-12/23
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Looks like you missed that one in your culinary education,"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-2/c-13/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Geonbae!"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-2/c-13/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Nice one,"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Ok, here's your order! Dig in!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Let's try this..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa's dishes are sumptuous, abundant, and full of bold, contrasting flavors."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "This is definitely comfort food, and the gloves are off when it comes to spices, sauces, and carbs."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The combination of Hawaiian and Korean flavors contrasts and compliments, ultimately fusing into something utterly unique."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/40/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fermented vegetables, meats dripping with sugary pineapple sauce, and rice, lots of rice."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/41/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fresh-roasted tubers, and rice, lots of rice."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/44
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Interesting... what do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is unlike anything I've ever had before..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "THIS SLAPS!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not bad. Might be too much for me though."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>whispering</i> Can we get moving?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-14/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "So...?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-14/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So I LOVE IT!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-14/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So it might be a bit too experimental for me."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-14/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I agree!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-14/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "To have made something so original and yet so delicious is a real win."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-14/15/c-0/26
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Koa, you've outdone yourself."
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-14/15/c-0/34
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-14/15/c-0/39
msgctxt "Narration / joueur"
msgid ", I must applaud your open mind!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-14/15/c-0/47
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I find that to be quite sexy."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-14/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Agreed. Alas, it's a bit... out there."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-14/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "It was a noble exploration but it doesn't quite work."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-15/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Quite! I'll be including your win in my review."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-16/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "It's all a bit too heavy."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-16/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Can't say it's for me, either."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-17/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I think we'll pass on seconds."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-17/18
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You'll be seeing my review shortly, Koa."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-3/c-17/26
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "...brace yourself."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "My friend and I are about finished here."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Koa. Thank you for having us."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You two are welcome back anytime!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DyinForHawaiian/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Thanks for stopping by!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You arrive at Freddy Yeti's new ice cream joint: \"The Yummy Yeti.\""
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's a herky-jerky establishment, to say the least. The ice trays are slipping and sliding everywhere."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The frozen peas and fruit have not yet been moved totally out of the way."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/37
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And Freddy himself is hard at work trying to put together the last touches on his icy creations."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/48
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "We have arrived!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/59
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Hey guys! Great to see ya!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/70
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "I'll be right with you, as soon as I finish mixing this... Dang strawberries won't blend..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/84
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Hmmm... What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/92/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Rustic. In the best way. Feels like home!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/93/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I expected it to be a bit more... inviting?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I agree. Rather charming! The sort of place I'd love to bring a date..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'll note this down."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Yes, yes... rather cold. And a bit of a mess."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Freddy, you knew we were coming, did you not?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "To be honest with you the pages in the reservation book got totally frozen shut."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "How... unfortunate. For you..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Grab a seat, guys! Pop yourselves down on that there box of Hogan Doe's bars."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I hope we won't be eating pre-packaged foods!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Haha! Not at all! Just part of the aesthetic."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's so creative! I love it!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Old boxes of off-brand ice cream for stools? Hmm."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'm so glad you approve. I want you to enjoy yourself while we are out together!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And I must say, Freddy, it really is a good idea!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Ah shucks! You're makin' me feel all nice and cold inside!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "How crude. I can't help but note that down."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I can see what you were going for, Freddy, but it's not working."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Yeesh. Loosen up..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-0/c-3/31
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "If we all loosened up as much as you have here, we'd be falling apart like old sweaters."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Have you got menus?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Nope! But look at this!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Freddy points at a long bar of ice, into which he's frozen the various flavor combinations."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Strawberries, bananas, pieces of chocolate, vanilla beans..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And beside each he has painstakingly (if a bit sloppily) carved the names in ice."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-1/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Those names are pretty much illegible..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-1/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Freddy that's so COOL! Pun intended."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "But can't you see what the flavors are?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-1/c-4/18
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I don't think we came here to play a guessing game, Freddy."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Thanks guys!!! Mitchell, you inspired the idea."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-1/c-5/18
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'm touched!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Anyhow, we've got strawberry-vanilla swirl, chocolate chill, coffee with cream, and classic vanilla."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "What'll it be?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You first, mon ami."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "So much about a person can be determined by their choice in ice cream flavors..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wanna swirl things up with that luscious strawberry?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's chill with that chocolate!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shall we caffeinate while we refrigerate?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Vanilla."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "OOh! I dare say let's get a bit mixed up!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/c-6/18
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I love a good dance of flavors..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "One does not simply \"Chill\" with chocolate!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/c-7/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "One INDULGES in her. One LUXURIATES in the devouring of her decadence!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/c-7/23
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Your lack of respect for the consecration of cacao..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/c-7/31
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Has been NOTED."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Getting energized for the evening, I see..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/c-8/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I approve of high-energy hedonism!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "How drab and uninteresting."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-2/c-9/18
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I am not at all impressed."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Well!? Don't just leave me hangin! How is it!?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "FREDERICK. Can I call you Frederick? It's absolutely sublime."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, Freddy, it's absolutely divin- You know what? I suck at lying. It's terrible."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorta kinda meh, if I'm being honest."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Oh that makes me so happy!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/c-10/18
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Freddy. Dare I say it, this is the most voluptuously iced cream I've ever had the pleasure..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/c-10/26
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Nay, the HONOR, of tasting!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/c-10/37
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "BraVO my friend. Bravissimo!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Oh boy... Ok... Well, I guess it is what it is."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/c-11/15
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "I'm sorry it was so disappointing."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/c-11/26
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I. Am. Saddened."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/c-11/34
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "By your lack of concern for the delicacy that is a creamed ice."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/c-11/42
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "This barely qualifies as edible."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Yikes... That hurts."
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/c-12/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I have to say I agree with our friend,"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/c-12/28
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "This is a 'C' at best."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-3/c-12/36
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Which in my book, is not a passing grade."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Well guys, I've only got one more thing to offer."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "And that's my Every-Day-Is-Sundae."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "That sounds interesting..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm full."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lay it on me, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Ah crumbs! I should've started with it."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/7
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "First we've got the ice cream... Vanilla and brown-butter caramel."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just take me now, why don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not a fan of caramel, actually."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Consider me titillated."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Neither am I."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Then comes the chocolate syrup, which has been heated."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Next we have a subtle glaze of butterscotch."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, you SLUT."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're a naughty, naughty boy..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/16/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bit much, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Mon dieu!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "But we <i>like</i> it!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/16/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And after we've already had a first cone?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Some ground roasted almonds for a crunch..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/16/g-0/8
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "A bit of whipped cream..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/16/g-0/16
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "And last but not least"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/16/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Give it to me, Freddy."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/16/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "TAKE ME YOU NASTY ANIMAL!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/16/g-0/24/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I just got full looking at all this."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/16/g-0/24/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Enough with the foreplay!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/16/g-0/24/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "YES! YES!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-4/c-14/15/g-0/16/g-0/24/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I think perhaps we'll pass afterall."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Well, my friends, that's everything I had for you!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "I know it's a bit rough still, but I hope you had a good time."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "I'm not exactly a trained waiter..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-5/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We could kinda tell..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-5/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Au contraire! I thought the service was great!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-5/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your service was good."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-5/c-15/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Some training might help you in the future."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-5/c-15/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Let me know me if you'd like a few pointers."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-5/c-16/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Je suis d'accord!"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-5/c-16/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And might I say,"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-5/c-16/20
msgctxt "Narration / joueur"
msgid ", that your grasp of French grasps at my heart..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-5/c-17/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Indeed. Perfectly suitable, Freddy."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Thank you again for having us on such short notice."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Keep an eye out for my review..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/IceCreamDream/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Very well now, human, we must be going!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you make your way back to the kitchen, there's a reflective silence. Your hand grazes Mitchell, and he looks at you. It's hard to read his gaze."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/14
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I... Ahem..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I felt it, too..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes Mitchell?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's just get back to the kitchen, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Felt what?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Felt that heat, that electricity..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Felt our bodies bump together. My mistake."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-0/15/c-0/13
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I... well... Yes. I suppose there's no use denying it."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-0/15/c-0/24
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I think there is something between us."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-0/15/c-0/32
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Perhaps we can continue to meet like this, and see where it leads us?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-0/15/c-1/13
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Yes. A mistake, obviously."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I was just wondering..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "What would you rate our evening, overall?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "10/10. Your company was wonderful, but our meal was the real delight."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "10/10. The food was delicious, but your company was perfection."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-1/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "5/10. The food flagged... but with you any night is a dream..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-1/23/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "1/10. I'mma level with you. Wasn't the best date."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I couldn't agree more. The meal made my heart sing."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You are too kind..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-1/23/c-2/13
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "To have had a wonderful night in spite of sub-par food?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-1/23/c-2/21
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "That compliment lands on my heart like an arrow from cupid's bow..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-1/23/c-3/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Well! You're entitled to your own review, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Of course. My apologies."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/3
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Ah. We've arrived. This is the end of our night, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It doesn't have to be..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Almost. <i>Kiss him.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, alas! I'll be back soon!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Later, Mitch."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-3/7/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Let us help ourselves to a second feast... a feast of pleasure."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-3/7/b/12
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Making love to Mitchell is like eating at the most extraordinary restaurant you can imagine."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-3/7/b/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He has style, elegance, and great poise. His attention to every detail of your desire is impeccable."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-3/7/b/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He teases you in with appetizers of foreplay, and builds up to the entree of your pleasure with the utmost skill."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-3/7/b/39
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "By the time you are cuddling in the sensual aftermath of dessert, you are utterly, completely sated."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-3/7/b/47
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And now, I must bid you adieu..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-3/7/b/55
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Until we meet again."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-3/8/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'm afraid it does. Goodnight my friend... Perhaps another time."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-4/7/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You lean in and kiss Mitchell, delicately on the lips."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-4/7/b/9
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He is at first surprised, but then returns your kiss with redoubled passion."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-4/7/b/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He tastes of the most glorious and unexpected combination of flavors imaginable."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-4/7/b/28
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "In fact, it's quite beyond your imagination. Quite beyond words."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-4/7/b/36
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "I, the narrator, am having trouble knowing how to describe it. All I can say is that it's... delicious."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-4/7/b/44
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And then, before you know it, it's done, and he's pulled away... Leaving you desperate for more."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-4/7/b/52
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Ahem... Before we get carried away... I must bid you adieu."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-4/7/b/60
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I hope to see you soon, my dear."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-4/8/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Just as you are leaning in to kiss him, Mitchell holds up a hand."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-4/8/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'm afraid we mustn't put the main course before the appetizer..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-4/8/b/17
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "So while I'm flattered, let us bid one another adieu for now."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Bonsoir!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellMakesAMove/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "It's 'Mitchell,' you cad."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/Reviews/1/b/1/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Hi there! I'm just finishing up my latest round of reviews! Care to have a read?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/Reviews/1/b/2/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Which review next?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/Reviews/1/b/5/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's hear Koa's Fusion BBQ joint."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/Reviews/1/b/6/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about Freddy's ice cream place?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/Reviews/1/b/7/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's read Daisuke's sushi shop review."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/10
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Koa's 'Two Currents.'"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/18
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Let us see..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/29/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "When we walked into the living room for our lunch rendezvous, there was a lot to take in."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/29/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Hawaiian and Korean themes blended seamlessly in this laid-back BBQ joint."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/29/b/17
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Palm-shack decor, as if we were transported to Maui..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/29/b/25
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "But with traditional Korean furnishings reminiscent of Seoul's best restaurants..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/29/b/33
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Not to mention the comfiest couch seats you could imagine."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/29/b/41
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Bravo!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/30/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "As we approached, I already had a sense that Koa's approach to ambiance was a 'miss.'"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/30/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "The clashing decoration styles were confusing, not complimentary."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/30/b/17
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And my guest seemed not to understand it, either."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/30/b/25
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Sadly, it is this critic's opinion that Koa should have stuck to something simpler."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/30/b/33
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And something that he could have better executed."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/0 mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "But what about the food?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/8/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "The food? Simply put, this is comfort food that is big on comfort..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/8/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And we are HERE for it!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/8/b/20
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "My guest and I loved the criss-crossing flavors that seemed to add a new punch to old classics."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/8/b/28
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "This fusion left us feeling fused to the couch, in the best possible way."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/8/b/36
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Koa has won big in the food department!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/9/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "If you want to be confused, filled up, and left wanting more, then Koa's food may be for you."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/9/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Unfortunately, we did not enjoy our meal."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/12/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "In conclusion:"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/12/8/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "If you want a fusion that leaves you feeling like you just toured the world..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/12/8/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "All without leaving the comfort of your own couch..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/12/8/b/17
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Koa's \"Two Currents\" is our current pick for best new restaurant in the living room!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/12/9/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Let me just say that I am disappointed."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/12/9/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "This felt like a real opportunity that was missed."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/12/9/b/17
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "It is this critic's hope that Koa can improve his offering..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/KoaReview/0/33/12/9/b/25
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "So that there will be one more reason to visit the living room in the future."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/10
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Ah yes, Freddy's 'Yummy Yeti.'"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/18
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Ahem."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/29/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "This rustic hole-in-the wall is, at first glance, nothing to write home about."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/29/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "But the frozen exterior belies an inner warmth that brings joy to the soul."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/29/b/17
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "From the icicles hanging off the sign, to the vintage ice cream box seats..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/29/b/25
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "The Yummy Yeti transports one to a magical frozen kingdom, reminiscent of a time gone by."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/29/b/33
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Ambiance? 5 stars!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/30/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "It's clear to see what Freddy was getting at with the decor."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/30/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "He was aiming for an old-style ice cream joint with updated touches."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/30/b/17
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "However, it became obvious from the moment we walked in that he wasn't prepared for guests."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/30/b/25
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And while the 'vintage' look was an interesting idea, it failed in execution."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/30/b/33
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Ambiance? 2 stars."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/8/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "While at the Yeti, we devoured two absolutely delightful frozen treats."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/8/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And let me assure you, this isn't the kind of place you go with a full stomach!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/8/b/17
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You'll want a single scoop of one of his unique flavors..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/8/b/25
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And don't forget to save space for his one-of-a-kind, decadent masterpiece:"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/8/b/33
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "The Every-Day-Is-Sundae!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/8/b/44
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Food? 5 stars!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/9/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Ice cream isn't something you can just 'whip up' in your spare time."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/9/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "A sublime delicacy at its best, when at its worst, ice cream is barely even edible."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/9/b/17
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Alas, that was the case with Freddy's attempt at this age old dessert."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/9/b/25
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "The ice cream was overly filling, watery, and clumsily presented."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/9/b/33
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Food? 1 star."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Service of course, can make or break a new restaurant. How was Freddy's?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/8/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "My lovely guest and I were tended to, and immediately made to feel right at home."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/8/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "We were never without our host's attention."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/8/b/17
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "He saw to it that we treated ourselves to whatever we liked!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/8/b/25
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "5 glowing stars for service."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/9/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "We arrived to a frozen guest book."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/9/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "The host barely looked up as we walked in."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/9/b/17
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Was he cordial? Sure. But a true host? Not even close."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/9/b/25
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "A sad 2 stars for service, I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/12/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "All in all?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/12/8/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Well, dear friends, I must say that new ice cream joint in town is an absolute accomplishment!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/12/8/b/12
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "All things considered? Freddy Yeti has cracked the code..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/12/8/b/20
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Or should I say 'cracked the cone?'"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/12/8/b/28
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Your faithful critic can highly recommend it."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/12/9/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I wanted to like this restaurant."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/12/9/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Freddy is, as many of you know, a dear friend."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/12/9/b/17
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "However, my duty calls, and as a critic I must distance myself from the subject of my review."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/12/9/b/25
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I am sad to say that The Yummy Yeti is more like The Mediocre Yeti at best."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FreddyReview/0/33/12/12/9/b/33
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And at worst? Let's just say that this critic cannot in good faith recommend it."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/10
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Here's my review for Omakase Daisuke!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/21/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "It's titled 'A Handrolled Disaster.'"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/21/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "When Omakase Daisuke opened up in the kitchen, expectations were high."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/21/b/17
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And unfortunately, the reality could not meet them."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/21/b/25
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Abysmal decor, an uninventive menu, and exorbitant prices..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/21/b/33
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And the most unappealing, revolting plating and presentation I've ever seen in my life."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/21/b/44
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "The final straw... the food was the worst sushi I've ever had."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/21/b/52
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I cannot in good conscience recommend anyone risk their life by eating there."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/21/b/60
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "This critic gives Omakase Daisuke 1 out of 5 stars."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/21/b/68
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I can only hope that whenever it inevitably closes, something better will take its place."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/22/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "The headline reads 'A Traditional Triumph.'"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/22/b/9
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "From the exquisitely understated decor to the traditional greetings at the door,"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/22/b/17
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Omakase Daisuke hits every single mark of a great sushi restaurant."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/22/b/25
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Ambiance, menu selection, food quality and value are of the highest grade."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/22/b/33
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "The at first glance hideous presentation belies sushi of the highest caliber—I've truly never tasted its equal."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/22/b/41
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "My guest and I enjoyed a wonderful, and dare I say romantic, dinner for two."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/22/b/49
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And I can recommend this restaurant without a shred of hesitation."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/22/b/57
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Omakase Daisuke receives 5 out of 5 stars."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/DaisukeReview/22/b/68
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "This new kid on the block is here to stay."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Now we have come to the most important review of them all..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/8
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Our reviews of one another."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/16
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "So, what do you think of me?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I find you quite palatable, as a friend."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd like to make a reservation... Romantic dinner for two?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm afraid your five star rating is about to suffer."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "My rating?! How dare you! The nerve!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/c-2/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's true, Mitchell. You're kind of a jerk."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/c-2/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't like that you're always cutting people down."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/c-2/18/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're a total snob."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/c-2/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Well, I NEVER!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/c-2/18/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "If I don't, who will!?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/c-2/18/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "A SNOB?!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I am only trying to keep the standards high around here!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "But apparently my work has gone unappreciated."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I guess you just don't have very refined tastes."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Good DAY!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellEndings2/0/g-0/73 mitchell_food/FriendshipQuestion/0/c-0/64 mitchell_food/HateEnding/105
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Delicious."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FriendshipQuestion/0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "To be honest, I'm not sure your palate is refined enough for my taste."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FriendshipQuestion/0/8
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "But might I propose a dinner out? As friends?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FriendshipQuestion/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was hoping for more than friends. I'm not interested."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FriendshipQuestion/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course! A friendship with you would be great."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FriendshipQuestion/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You dare reject my offer? Not before I reject you first!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FriendshipQuestion/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Consider yourself NEGATIVELY REVIEWED!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/RomanceEnding/0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'd be all too happy to accept that reservation. Where should we dine?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/RomanceEnding/0/11/s/0 mitchell_food/FriendshipEnding/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's go back to Freddy's."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/RomanceEnding/0/12/s/0 mitchell_food/FriendshipEnding/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's get a bite at Koa's."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/RomanceEnding/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's share a romantic sushi night."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/RomanceEnding/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why don't we do dinner in, for a change?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/RomanceEnding/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'd love nothing more than to indulge in the chill of ice cream..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/RomanceEnding/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "While feeling the heat smoulder between us."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/RomanceEnding/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Some comfort food and cuddling on the couch sounds divine."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/RomanceEnding/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And who knows where the night might lead after that?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/RomanceEnding/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "The refined ambiance of Daisuke's authentic restaurant?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/RomanceEnding/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Your refined self will fit right in."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/RomanceEnding/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I love the sound of that... Might I suggest we satisfy our 'other' appetites?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/RomanceEnding/0/g-0/0 mitchell_food/FriendshipEnding/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I think I'll leave my review notes at home for this one..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/RomanceEnding/0/g-0/8 mitchell_food/FriendshipEnding/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You're already five stars in my book."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HateEnding/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'm afraid I must tell you..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HateEnding/8
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "My review of your performance over these past few dates is not a good one."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HateEnding/16
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Your knowledge about the culinary industry is pathetic."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HateEnding/24
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Your attention to the finer points of dining experience is lacking."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HateEnding/32
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You are rude, crude, and have a poor attitude."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HateEnding/40
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And frankly, you smell of low quality beef."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HateEnding/51
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I give you a 1 out of 5 stars."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/HateEnding/59 mitchell_food/MitchellHateReturn/0/32
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Goodbye!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FriendshipEnding/0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I see that our tastes here are in alignment!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FriendshipEnding/0/11
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I can think of no better way to celebrate our friendship than to have a bite to eat."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FriendshipEnding/0/19 mitchell_food/MitchellFriendReturn/0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "What do you say, friend?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FriendshipEnding/0/27 mitchell_food/MitchellFriendReturn/0/8
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Shall we indulge?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/FriendshipEnding/0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's grab Omakase Daisuke!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Oh hello, you! I'm so glad you're here."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/8
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I wanted to ask you about something."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/16
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'm planning on inviting everyone in the kitchen to dine... at my place!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/24
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'd like to have a party of such class and character that none will forget it."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/32
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Every detail will be accounted for."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/40
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I shall provide the food, which will be exceptional, of course."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/48
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "But I'm missing just one component... The host!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/56
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'd love for you to fill that role."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/64
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You'd greet our distinguished guests on the way in, and make them feel welcome."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/72
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "What do you say?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/80/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love to host."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "And might I say, you look absolutely fabulous."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Everything is prepared."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Are you ready to start the feast?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's do it!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let me just adjust this bow tie..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about a kiss first?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you think these shoes are ok?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Oh, they can be finicky can't they?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I'll just... there you are!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Anything for you, you cheeky little devil."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Better than ok."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "You'll steal the show."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Perfect timing! Our guests are arriving now!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-1/8/b/10
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Is this the place where the food is... or..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-1/11/b/10
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Mitchell has gone above and beyond."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-1/14/b/10
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "A host? Well, well..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-1/17/b/10
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Rise and shine!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-1/20/b/10
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Reporting for duty!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-1/23/b/10
msgctxt "Miranda"
msgid "I can't wait to see what you've cooked up."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-1/26/b/10
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Now THIS is passionate provisions!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellTableauxIntro/0/g-1/29/b/10
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Hey!!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/how_many_guests/0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Eight guests! Everyone came!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/how_many_guests/0/1/b/1
msgctxt "Mitchell"
