msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Perhaps I was wrong about you."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellHateReturn/0/c-1/18/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Maybe we can be seen together at the dinner table after all."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/MitchellHateReturn/0/c-1/18/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Come, we dine!"
msgstr ""

