msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Timing is everything in a well-prepared dish. I will wait."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "The recipe awaits! Are you ready?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, chef!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Let's Realize food first! Yummy!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Mitchell... bon appetit!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely food, becomes...."
