#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Do you smell that? The alluring scent of truffle..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realized/0/14
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "The captivating aroma of a far-off Stilton..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realized/0/22
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "All these years of honing my senses... and now, I need only do what the other great critics have done."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realized/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Eat myself!!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realized/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mitchell takes a great handful of food from the fridge in what appears to be the indiscriminate gesticulations of one not accustomed to eating."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realized/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Peanut butter, tomato, vinegar, even baking soda, all go down his newly-formed throat."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realized/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "... so how was that?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realized/0/g-0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I have made a terrible mistake."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realized/0/g-0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "It would appear I have some recalibrating to do."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realized/0/g-0/c-1/34
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Can you point me in the direction of the nearest fine dining establishment?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realized/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's a decent bagel joint around the corner?"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realized/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I might be able to sate your appetite myself."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realized/0/g-1/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Every great story has humble beginnings."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_realized/0/g-1/c-3/7
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "I never knew how hungry I was until this moment."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_divert/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The meal that follows contains five courses..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_divert/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "From a tantalizing amuse bouche..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_divert/16
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Stop teasing me with your sweet kisses!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_divert/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "To an exquisite appetizer..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_divert/38
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "These positions you're putting me in are rather tangy... and I like it!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_divert/49
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A sumptuous main course awaits his pleasure..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_divert/57
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Well now... that was delightfully salty..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_divert/65
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Between sessions there is a natural palate cleanser..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_divert/73
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "This waiting game is too bitter for me. I'm ready for seconds!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_divert/84
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Until the decadent dessert arrives..."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_divert/92
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "<w>UMAMI!!!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_divert/106
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mitchell is left breathless."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_divert/114
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "...check please."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_join/0
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Now I'm ready to taste what this world has to offer."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mitchell makes a whirlwind food tour of the planet entire."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Upon completion he finally sets down his critics pen and musters the courage to open his own restaurant."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_join/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "In its first week it is absolutely skewered in the press."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_join/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And closes with disastrous financial consequences."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_join/43
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "Who would have thought that a restaurant themed around feeding me would have done so poorly? Those brutes!"
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_join/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mitchell hurriedly takes up his pen once more and becomes a much respected (and feared) critic."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_join/59
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "...of critics."
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_join/67
msgctxt "Mitchell"
msgid "\"Cottswold's review was sloppy, importune, inarticulate, and generally unpalatable. I won't be frequenting his column very much I'm afraid. You should do the same.\""
msgstr ""

#: mitchell_food/mitchell_love_join/75
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With his unique foods-eye-view perspective of culinary analysis, he finally finds the respect he so desperately hungered for."
msgstr ""
